  <item>
    <title>专业相关还是大厂优先？ 武大本硕能源动力类就业信息分享讨论与思考第二弹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6876763893fd2d72b85f1a90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6876763893fd2d72b85f1a90</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 15:59:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️本期主播：One_SONY</span></p><span></span><p><span>本来以为会有很多弹，没想到还是高估自己的时间规划能力了 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>能在毕业之后搞出第二弹已经达到极限</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎓 能源动力类就业分享第二弹 ⚡️</span></p><span></span><p><span>📊 第一章：行业大势 &amp; 数据真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 🗣️ 开场 &amp; 数据来源</span></p><span></span><p><span>研二辅导员分享会 + 毕业聚餐「身边统计学」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 📉 头部集中度骤降</span></p><span></span><p><span>23→25 年：华为/比亚迪从“七八人”→“三四人”→“几乎不撞车”，大厂缩招是主因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 🌐 专业广度=抗跌利器</span></p><span></span><p><span>能源动力类本科就业率全国第一，下行周期更显“兜底”优势</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏢 第二章：三大去向拆解</span></p><span></span><p><span>1️⃣ 专业对口（≈50%）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 🏗️ 大厂化国企</span></p><span></span><p><span>中广核/长江电力等：统一薪酬、学历门槛↑、海外项目机会↑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 🕸️ 隐形人脉圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>学长学姐密集、甲乙方可互跳，同学→甲方乙方关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 🌍 区域优先</span></p><span></span><p><span>按“想生活的城市”就近选单位，集中度低、个性化强</span></p><span></span><p><span>2️⃣ 泛大厂（≈30%）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 🚫 撕掉滤镜</span></p><span></span><p><span>“米粉→米黑”案例：品牌 ≠ 岗位体验，性价比产品=内部降本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 🤔 死磕 VS 灵活</span></p><span></span><p><span>招聘名额年际波动大，先就业再社招曲线救国更划算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 🔍 平台≠能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>瑞幸明星代言案例：别把平台杠杆错当自己实力</span></p><span></span><p><span>3️⃣ 升学 / 体制内（＜10%）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 🎓 读博的窄门</span></p><span></span><p><span>博士≈高校/科研赛道，就业面“缩小”；尊重深思熟虑者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 🏛️ 公务员 &amp; 选调</span></p><span></span><p><span>本专业三不限竞争激烈，选调生比例＞普岗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 🗣️ 作者个人彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>签小米武汉即止投，秋招“弹射起床”的掌控感 vs 研三摆烂日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 🤝 持续交流：欢迎同专业同学补充、勘误</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 祝各位 offer 多多，下期再见！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/670482de81cdab3a935d9a90/li9cVMKurkf_CWt312IlEZFD6MQr.m4a" length="18505244" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkNBP2j-8wzwrFpAO70fAlCrcVft.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>硕士刚毕业，调整心态直面收入焦虑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68483c501c45a6323282e8cd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68483c501c45a6323282e8cd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 14:12:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️本期主播：One_SONY</span></p><span></span><p><span>随便聊聊现在我持有的金钱观</span></p><span></span><p><span>📝 金钱观念分享 💰</span></p><span></span><p><span>一：金钱是手段还是目的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">00:08:54</a> 🎯 金钱的本质探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span>金钱不是生活的最终目的，而是实现理想生活的手段。</span></p><span></span><p><span>强调生活本身才是我们追求的目标，金钱只是帮助我们达成目标的工具。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到很多人把赚钱当作人生目标，但实际上应该思考赚钱之后的真正目的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>二：金钱的本质与社会资源分配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">00:08:54</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">00:18:41</a> 🌐 金钱与社会资源</span></p><span></span><p><span>金钱是一种社会资源分配的工具，帮助我们将资源投入到能够产生更多价值的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>举例说明如何通过创业和投资将金钱用于再生产，从而推动社会资源的有效分配。</span></p><span></span><p><span>讨论企业家与资本家的区别，强调企业家通过再投资推动社会进步，而资本家可能只关注个人财富积累。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三：个人理财与合理负债</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">00:18:41</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">00:23:16</a> 💼 个人财务管理</span></p><span></span><p><span>强调保持合理现金流的重要性，以便应对突发情况和抓住新的机会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享个人使用消费贷的经验，强调合理负债可以减少对现金流的占用，同时保持生活的灵活性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提出合理的负债率应该是能够通过现有收入逐步偿还，而不是过度依赖未来的收入。</span></p><span></span><p><span>四：生活与金钱的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">00:23:16</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">00:27:48</a> 🏠 生活的最低限度与多元收入</span></p><span></span><p><span>讨论生活的最低限度，强调即使收入不高，也可以通过合理规划过上幸福的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提出多元收入体系的概念，鼓励人们探索多种收入来源，而不是依赖单一的职业。</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享对未来的期许，希望未来的社会能够更加灵活，允许个人通过多种方式实现自我价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中提到的内容链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670a0f70db2cf827579c8b9d" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670a0f70db2cf827579c8b9d">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a> 对话好状态×栩栩华生｜何同学&amp;拉宏桑：过即兴人生，不做脆皮青年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6013f9f58e2f7ee375cf4216" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6013f9f58e2f7ee375cf4216">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a> 《知行小酒馆》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SM41197wn?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.11&amp;vd_source=53e7bceb8b21b6c18f08ab6710bc496a" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SM41197wn?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.11&amp;vd_source=53e7bceb8b21b6c18f08ab6710bc496a">www.bilibili.com</a> 如果不失业，永远都不会意识到自己“根本不会挣钱！”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/670482de81cdab3a935d9a90/ltVBokwouw6dAoO-L2O4ONqzPakw.m4a" length="20358828" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgh9EKeGgsJ6Ejpl5RP4H6kpXi31.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
