  <item>
    <title>研究生如何做到“靠自己”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6749354a0ed328720a23fa0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6749354a0ed328720a23fa0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 03:54:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️本期主播：One_SONY</span></p><span></span><p><span>靠自己并不代表没有朋友，踽踽独行，而是周围人来人往，我自岿然不动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑的时候发现声音好哑，用的 12mini 收音也不好，以后会有改进的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎓 </span><strong><span>研究生自我成长指南</span></strong><span> 🚀</span></p><span></span><h3><span>🌟 第一章：目标的探索 🎯</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a></span></strong><span> 🤔 开场与话题引入引入研究生自我依赖的话题。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a></span></strong><span> 🏫 个人经历分享分享个人成长经历和目标的确立。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a></span></strong><span> 🚀 目标的明确与调整如何通过经历明确自己的职业目标。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🌟 第二章：生活的平衡 🏋️‍♂️</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a></span></strong><span> 🏛️ 研究生的生活观念对研究生期间生活的看法。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a></span></strong><span> 🌆 研究生生活与职场生活的比较研究生生活对职场生活的预示。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a></span></strong><span> 💡 生活的重要性强调研究生生活中生活平衡的必要性。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🌟 第三章：科研与学习 📚</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a></span></strong><span> 🧠 科研中的自我依赖如何在科研和学习中实现自我依赖。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a></span></strong><span> 🌡️ 同温层的重要性寻找同龄人的支持和理解。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a></span></strong><span> 🤓 老师和师兄师姐的角色如何有效利用老师和师兄师姐的资源。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🌟 🎉 </span><strong><span>总结与彩蛋</span></strong><span> 🥚</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a></span></strong><span> 🌱 目标的自然生长通过生活经历自然形成和调整目标。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a></span></strong><span> 💡 自由与青春的感悟对自由和青春的深刻理解。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a></span></strong><span> 📢 从高中到研究生举例，靠自己的重要性。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>👋 </span><strong><span>下期再见！</span></strong><span> 👋</span></p>]]></description>
