  <item>
    <title>拒当毫无成长的实习生——从微博小案例到破除学生思维</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ca5588d1233fb0d746a96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ca5588d1233fb0d746a96</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 15:16:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️本期主播：One_SONY &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近做了两个视频，播客很久没更新啦，本期聊一个微博上听到的小案例，补充一些自己的思考。</span><br><span>有时候看到评论区的一些很浅的评价就会很生气，而做内容反驳这些浅评就是我表达自己愤怒的方式。</span><br><span>借用 Melody 的一句话：</span><strong><span>“我发表的所有观点，都是在为我想要的世界投票。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📘 Chapter 1: Introduction &amp; Case Study</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 🎤 开场介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>在北京开会，酒店录制博客</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享微博案例，分析实习生职场适应问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 📖 案例介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习生询问转正问题，小领导无法保证</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习生态度变化，工作积极性下降</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习生交流少，小领导微博吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span>📘 Chapter 2: Public Reactions &amp; Criticisms</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 🗣️ 公众反应</span></p><span></span><p><span>评论区四大批评声音</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习生不愿搞职场关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>小领导PUA实习生</span></p><span></span><p><span>不应教育年轻人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小领导网络吐槽不面对面沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 🤔 我的逻辑与辩驳</span></p><span></span><p><span>基于事实讨论，实习生有留下意愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>📘 Chapter 3: Key Reflections &amp; Advice</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 🌐 未来不确定性</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望对未来有确定性预测的不现实性</span></p><span></span><p><span>特斯拉毁约案例说明未来不可预测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 💪 努力与结果的互为因果</span></p><span></span><p><span>转正结果与工作表现相关</span></p><span></span><p><span>积极工作态度的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 🤔 主动思考与自驱力</span></p><span></span><p><span>理解逻辑后主动工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>克服懒惰，提升成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 📊 获取信息为我所用</span></p><span></span><p><span>与同事交流获取信息的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>信息帮助做出职业选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 📢 网友想法的局限性</span></p><span></span><p><span>网友评论出于正义感，但不一定有益</span></p><span></span><p><span>讨论基于实习生有留下意愿的前提</span></p><span></span><p><span>📘 Chapter 4: Conclusion &amp; Personal Growth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">16:17</a> 🚫 反对贴标签</span></p><span></span><p><span>反对网络上的贴标签行为</span></p><span></span><p><span>应就事论事，允许不同意见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 📖 案例的普遍性</span></p><span></span><p><span>案例可抽象化，适用于多种情况</span></p><span></span><p><span>职场问题可参考此案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 🏁 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享目的非求认可，而是鼓励思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>理论与实践经验的重要性</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgEE6Xkuqlwqt7FTXSNGY5UFRT3d.m4a" length="18835958" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAEkslNQ_FrkBuev1q7Rus3s24I.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>什么&amp;为什么是「去中心个体」？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670de454db2cf827574ae75f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670de454db2cf827574ae75f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2024 03:41:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️本期主播：One_SONY</span></p><span></span><p><span>思考了很久的一些观点，都总结在播客和Shownotes里了</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许从这期开始，我小小的播客《去中心个体》才能算是正式启航</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么我希望和你一起期待贯彻「去中心化」与充满「超级个体」的未来世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><strong><span>契机</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>📘 参加论文指导老师项目，需要录制试讲课，发现适合录播客。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎧 受其他播客创作者鼓励，想尝试个人创作。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎤 为秋招面试购买麦克风，音质满意，决定用于录播客。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🏫 实验室独处时间多，思考个人未来和内容创作，产生表达欲。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><strong><span>形式</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>📝 使用提纲而非台本，对着摄像头自然表达。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>📽 视频剪辑以剪掉错误和气口为主，保留自然表达。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🕒 每期节目投入约4小时，追求低成本高效率。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎬 曾制作过播放量超10万的视频，证明剪辑能力。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><strong><span>名称内涵</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🌐 「去中心个体」由「去中心化」和「超级个体」组成，代表对世界的理解。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🔗 去中心化是社会发展的必然逻辑，体现在UGC内容、个人创业、企业规模等方面。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🚀 超级个体指被工具和AI赋能的个体，能在业余时间创造丰富内容。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><strong><span>总结</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🌟 理想主义者，相信世界会变得更好，即使过程螺旋上升。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🏷️ 考虑在个人简介中表明政治倾向，但担心被标签化。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🔗 我们与理想世界有距离，但应努力创造。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><strong><span>片尾</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🎶 分享片尾曲，强调歌词含义，感受歌曲力量。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>📽 展示B站补档视频。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👋 节目结束，感谢听众，再见。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期中出现的软件：</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪映——全能易用的桌面端剪辑软件，AI赋能</span></p><span></span><p><span>Obsidian——一款强大且可扩展的知识库，它运行在本地纯文本文件夹之上</span></p><span></span><p><span>Notion——在互联工作空间中管理 Wikis 百科、文档和项目</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期中出现的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《半拿铁》——商业背后的故事主播：刘飞Lufy、潇磊</span></p><span></span><p><span>《纵横四海》——人类使用说明书主播：携隐Melody</span></p><span></span><p><span>（中间有一段误读成了蜘蛛侠动画电影第二部的副标题纵横宇宙了）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期中出现的UP主：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@老蒋巨靠谱</span></p><span></span><p><span>@月亮猹-</span></p><span></span><p><span>@林亦LYi</span></p><span></span><p><span>@老师好我叫何同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>@毕导</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾分享语来源：</span></p><span></span><p><span>BV1ZLx3eQERq——《雷军，一个理想主义者》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲帮大家找了两个好听的版本：</span></p><span></span><p><span>BV15tWHeqE8m——《《国际歌》管弦乐版》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BV1cK411j75G——巅峰之作！唐朝乐队-重金属《国际歌》【黑胶高音质】</span></p>]]></description>
