  <item>
    <title>为何被骂？武汉大学突然更换共享电动车供应商舆情分析</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6706a2b46c7f817786e20e35</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6706a2b46c7f817786e20e35</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 15:35:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong><span>One_SONY</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二期来啦，剪辑的时候发现了两个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>一是模糊了共享电动车和共享单车的说法，因为校内只有共享电动车，所以说的所有共享单车其实都是电动车</span></p><span></span><p><span>二是有一段把小红书分享的人默认为女生，这是不严谨的</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>话题：</span></strong><span> 武汉大学更换共享单车供应商引发的舆情</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>日期：</span></strong><span> 2024年9月初</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>关键词</span></strong><span>： 共享电动车、供应商更换、校园舆情</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>📌 时间戳与内容摘要</span></h2><span></span><h3><span>第一章：事件背景</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong><span> 🌐 事件引入</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>武汉大学9月初更换共享电动车供应商的背景介绍。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></strong><span> 🚲 更换原因</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>保卫部会议决定更换共享电动车供应商，原供应商服务期限到期。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a></span></strong><span> 📢 学生反应</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>学生对更换供应商的初步反应和不满情绪。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>第二章：事件发展</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a></span></strong><span> 🆕 新供应商介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>新供应商湖北知音漫客有限公司和湖北小象创意科技有限公司介绍。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a></span></strong><span> 📈 收费变更</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>新供应商收费方案变更，起步价降低，但超过20分钟后价格大幅上升。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a></span></strong><span> 💬 校园讨论</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>学生在社交媒体上对新共享单车供应商的讨论和反馈。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>第三章：个人思考与总结</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a></span></strong><span> 🤔 个人思考</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主讲人对事件的个人思考，包括对校园舆情和学生反应的分析。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a></span></strong><span> 🔄 习惯改变</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>讨论人们对于习惯改变的抗拒和事件对学生习惯的影响。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a></span></strong><span> 🌟 推动变革</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主讲人对如何推动校园变革和改进决策过程的建议。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> - 结束</span></strong><span> 🏁 结语</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主讲人总结并对未来的展望。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqjY_AmOljaNA1VlAKMbbjmXrc-E.m4a" length="49275038" type="audio/mp4"/>
